{"author":{"id":"a3a282966ced55effb4560271fcd98e13241af24ea76b00ec76a0f18154bc8ee"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1790188702,"nonce":"eLe8TQt0bUMZ+Ktlj9ztK7Ab21U=","title":"Decided 2026-09-23 with Luis.","message":"1. Refs are the runtime source of truth for schema AND flows. Source files in the tree (schema.yaml, flows/*.star) are authoring artifacts: reviewed in PRs, merged by git as text, and applied to refs/work-schema and refs/work-flows only by explicit `git work schema import` / `git work flow import`; `export` writes them back and export|import is a no-op. Nothing reads the tree at runtime, so a checkout can never diverge from the store (Luis: using the commit as source of truth is a non-starter because it diverges from the schema). The two imports run together so schema and flows move as one.\n\n2. A flow is a config entity in refs/work-flows, same generic document as type and field: attributes `script` (Starlark source), `description`, `bindings` (name -\u003e field key, e.g. start/end/estimate/assignee, what roles used to be). Last-writer-wins on the whole script is correct here because the only writer is import; the text merge already happened in git. Archived is the removal.\n\n3. Language: Starlark (go.starlark.net). Measured a realistic board flow (query all, filter by label, group by status, sort per column, sum points), conversion of issues into Starlark values included: 3.3 ms per 1k issues (1.4 ms conversion), 39 ms per 10k. Step cap per run, no I/O except the host API. Host API (b511c63): query(jq program), get, set, add, remove, new, comment, render_list, render_board, args, me. `git work flow \u003cname\u003e [args]` runs one; a saved view is a flow returning a render spec that the TUI/GUI draw and re-run on ref change. Nothing of ours compiles anything; filters and sorts are gojq programs passed as strings.\n\n4. Presets ship default flows as embedded files applied by `schema init` through the same import path, so a fresh repo has a board and a backlog before anyone writes a line.","files":null},{"type":9,"timestamp":1790188702,"nonce":"xuEWQsvzxgWQJGrTEu4XToYNlaY=","key":"type","value":"decision"},{"type":9,"timestamp":1790188702,"nonce":"fRgl9RcOhao7dEEDtzcrl7saedw=","key":"status","value":"to-do"}]}